      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“请看看她这沉着冷静的姿态！\n过去有赛马娘在GⅠ获胜后，\n像她如此冷静的吗？”",
      "source_fingerprint": "35402980cfbf2a19a1f645195089fb58511eb086dff5f50750d5e951863ffda0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
