      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“真的十分帅气呢！\n看起来浑身充满自信，\n可说是威风凛凛！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e07593d7ec51750a80ae887454a1b8c4a2d9b649208efa41f8d922d54ded5ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
