      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“她非常有安定感呢。\n该说是海外赛马娘特有的强劲吗──\n希望日本赛马娘也要努力别输给她。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "f04a8bfdf90a818b09d8d33bbc0229e03394f82516a7576b87a7aefbea8fe36b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
